1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,130
The deepest ocean could
swallow Mount Everest.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:06,820
After 200 meters,
sunlight is already fading.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:10,250
At 1,000 meters,
it disappears.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,400
The average ocean is nearly
3.7 kilometers deep.

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:19,170
Now place Mount Everest
on the bottom.

6
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:23,920
Its summit would still be more than
two kilometers underwater.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,420
Challenger Deep.
Nearly 11 kilometers below the surface.
